    <preface>
      <p>Superannuation (Departing Australia Superannuation Payments Tax) Amendment Act 2016</p>
      <p>No. 90, 2016</p>
      <p>An Act to amend the <i>Superannuation (Departing Australia Superannuation Payments Tax) Act 2007</i>, and for related purposes</p>
      <p>Contents</p>
      <p>1	Short title	2</p>
